cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SpikeIDS v5: Leakage-Safe and Reproducible Four-Dataset Intrusion Detection"
message: >-
  This working tree is an unreleased version-5 revision. Cite the exact
  repository revision or the plan-addressed artifact bundle used in your work;
  do not cite the historical Zenodo v1 record as if it contained v5.
