  - quantized-neural-network
  - onnx
  - edge-ai
abstract: >-
  A fail-closed experimental pipeline for ReLU MLP, QCFS quantized-activation
  MLP, TinyCNN, Random Forest, and XGBoost intrusion-detection experiments on
  NSL-KDD, UNSW-NB15, CICIDS2017, and IoT-23. Version 5 binds audited source
  data, fit-only preprocessing, validation-based checkpoint selection,
  independent deterministic repetitions, paired statistical families, and
  sampled ONNX/QDQ software gates. It does not claim unseen-device or
  capture/time generalization, full-NPU placement, physical-board latency, or
  energy without separate evidence.
